## 📚 Quick Reference: 2026 Angular Patterns

### State Management
```typescript
// Signal (for reactive state)
const count = signal(0);
count.set(5);
count.update(v => v + 1);

// Computed (for derived state)
const doubled = computed(() => count() * 2);

// Effect (for side effects)
effect(() => {
  console.log('Count:', count());
});
```

### Forms (Signal Forms, 2026 Standard)
```typescript
// Two-way binding with signals
user = model<User>({ name: '', email: '' });

// Validation as computed
isValid = computed(() => this.user().email.includes('@'));

// Template
<input [(ngModel)]="user().email">
<button [disabled]="!isValid()">Save</button>
```

### Control Flow (2026 Standard)
```typescript
// Conditional
@if (condition()) { ... } @else { ... }

// Loop
@for (let item of items(); track item.id) { ... }

// Switch
@switch (status()) {
  @case ('loading') { ... }
  @default { ... }
}
```

### Lazy Loading
```typescript
// Routes
loadComponent: () => import('./dashboard.component').then(m => m.DashboardComponent)

// Components
@defer (on viewport) {
  <app-heavy-chart></app-heavy-chart>
} @placeholder {
  <p>Loading...</p>
}
```

### Change Detection (Zoneless)
```typescript
// Enable zoneless (2026 default)
bootstrapApplication(AppComponent, {
  providers: [provideExperimentalZonelessChangeDetection()]
});

// Optimize with OnPush
@Component({
  changeDetection: ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush
})
```

### Testing (Vitest)
```typescript
// Test signals
service.count.set(5);
expect(service.count()).toBe(5);

// Test computed
expect(service.doubled()).toBe(10);

// Test effects
effect(() => { /* test side effect */ });
```

